# The gates decide what may be called a derivation of Principia Mathematica.
#
# Everything else in this repository is a claim; these files are what makes a
# claim checkable. A weakened gate costs nothing at the moment it is weakened
# and invalidates every certification made afterwards — this repository has
# already carried 969 items marked certified that were not.
#
# Requiring review here does not make the standard unchangeable. It makes
# changing it a decision someone signs for, in a diff that says so.

